    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wait... It\u2019s not JUST Snap???</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We fibbed\u2014\u201cJust Snap\u201d isn\u2019t merely a copy of the classic card game &quot;Snap&quot;.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s Snap after it spent a gap year at the Bloingo Department of Music &amp; Acoustics (shout\u2011out to our resident sound sorcerers, Chris &amp; Jake) and came back shredding 130\u00a0BPM guitar solos while juggling decks of chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SO, WHAT\u2019S THE BLOINGO HYPE ABOUT?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm\u2011Powered Duels</strong>\u00a0\u2013 Slam cards exactly on the beat to steal stacks, bend tempo or reverse time. Miss the beat? Kiss your combo goodbye.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>120 Launch\u2011Day Ability Cards</strong> \u2013 Build break\u2011beat decks, tempo\u2011trap decks or \u201cWhoops\u2011all\u2011drums\u201d decks.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bloingo Cards</strong> \u2013 Wild cards that flip the music, warp BPM, or yoink your rival\u2019s entire hand. Perfect for polite friendship\u2011ending moments.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six Musical Arenas</strong> \u2013 From Lo\u2011Fi Lounge (80\u00a0BPM) to Drum &amp; Bass Dojo (170\u00a0BPM). Every arena forces new timing\u2014and sick new tracks.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online 1\u00a0v\u00a01 &amp; Friend Lobbies</strong>\u00a0\u2013 Ranked ladder for sweats, custom rooms for party chaos, built\u2011in spectator mode for drama\u2011queens.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck Builder That Won\u2019t Melt Your Brain</strong>\u00a0\u2013 Unlock cards gradually, test builds instantly, save unlimited decks. No \u201coption\u2011paralysis\u201d phd required.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards, Achievements &amp; Replays</strong>\u00a0\u2013 Because flexing your S\u2011rank sync score feels good.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Controller &amp; Steam\u00a0Deck Support</strong> \u2013 Snap anywhere, any\u2011way. Steam Cloud keeps your decks safe.  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHY WE MADE IT?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional card games can get sleepy. Rhythm games can get one\u2011note. We smashed them together so you can slay beats, out\u2011strategise RNG, and stay hooked for \u201cone more track\u201d (and then five).  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHO\u2019S MAKING IT?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloingo Games = three BCSS game\u2011jam champs + two pro musicians + gallons of coffee. Data\u2011driven brains, melodic hearts, minimal budget\u2011blowing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&lt;3 THANKS FOR LISTENING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now quit reading\u2014go warm up those fingers and get ready to Snap on the down\u2011beat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635700/extras/187e9b50d92507937e2747522b93b53b.poster.avif?t=1745101883\" width=640 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635700/extras/187e9b50d92507937e2747522b93b53b.webm?t=1745101883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635700/extras/187e9b50d92507937e2747522b93b53b.mp4?t=1745101883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
